          "Arti_kata_in": "betul/lurus",
          "Arti_kata_en": "the correct",
          "Text_latin  ": "al-qayimati"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Nomor_ayat": 6,
      "Ayat_arabic ": "اِنَّ الَّذِيْنَ كَفَرُوْا مِنْ اَهْلِ الْكِتٰبِ وَالْمُشْرِكِيْنَ فِيْ نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ خٰلِدِيْنَ فِيْهَاۗ اُولٰۤىِٕكَ هُمْ شَرُّ الْبَرِيَّةِۗ",
      "Ayat_latin": "innallazina kafaru min ahlil-kitabi wal-musyrikina fi nari jahannama khalidina fiha, ula'ika hum syarrul-bariyyah",
      "Terjemah_in": "Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang kufur dari golongan Ahlulkitab dan orang-orang musyrik (akan masuk) neraka Jahanam. Mereka kekal di dalamnya. Mereka itulah seburuk-buruk makhluk.",
      "Terjemah_en": "Those who disbelieve among the People of the Scripture, and the Polytheists, will be in the Fire of Hell, where they will abide forever. These are the worst of creatures.",
